abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of Fluid Spacetime Omni-Theory (FSOT) 2.1, whose core
  scalar law S = K(T1 + T2 + T3) is computed from mathematical seed constants
  with zero free parameters, together with a reproducible comparison of its
  outputs against public measured data.
keywords: [fsot, lean4, formal-verification, physics, reproducible-research]
